  "x-field-policy": "All listed object fields are required and closed; nullable values are explicit. Strict integers exclude bool; all JSON numbers finite. Contract semantic checks are required in addition to schema. No scoring expressions or dynamic record registry.",
  "x-semantic-validation": [
    "Native files match the exact original fixed output specs, excluding only batch_manifest, in original order. The original request retains every set and pair position.",
    "Capture transport rows copy original capture declarations and observed identities exactly. A missing current retained path never rewrites an original successful capture or original native facts.",
    "For declaration_source batch or pair, capture is nonnull; retained, if present, names exactly capture.observed. For declaration_source none, capture is null; a retained identity is actual undeclared captured bytes, never an invented original declaration.",
    "Native selector mode is native_result with saved_sheet_file null. Saved selector mode is saved_sheet_recalculation and saved_sheet_file exactly equals sheet.file. The only calculation parameters are selector.parameters.",
    "Only explicit retained paths can be opened. Each path is canonical absolute regular-file input without symlink traversal and outside the output directory. Repeated same retained path is permitted only with exact identical file identity; aliases with conflicting identity reject.",
    "Sealed native parsed-set JSON and manifests preserve canonical JSON plus one LF per packet425. Worker output JSON and saved sheet are canonical UTF-8 with no LF. Exact whole-byte identities are verified before decoding.",
    "Diagnostics adds current conversion availability only; original manifests, capture rows and original action/lifecycle receipts remain the original facts and authority.",
    "WorkerResult outputs are exactly sheet/sheet.json/genomic_region_overlap_sheet_v1, components/components.json/genomic_region_overlap_components_v1, projection/projection.json/genomic_overlap_projection_v1, diagnostics/diagnostics.json/genomic_overlap_result_diagnostics_v1, in that order.",
    "Diagnostics is present after normal worker return; present declarations contain actual SHA/size, absent declarations contain null SHA/size. Worker result never contains a manufactured output NativeFileIdentity.",
    "WorkerResult state produced means all three scientific output files present; partial means some but not all; unavailable means none. This is file-production state, not scientific extent, native success or delivery completeness.",
    "Components require sheet; projection requires both sheet and components. source_sheet_sha256 is null iff sheet is absent, otherwise exactly sheet declaration.sha256 and the component/projection source_sheet_sha256.",
    "Saved processing never reads source/native/canonical files or prior components and never probes a binary, uses network, or replaces the selected sheet. The saved sheet output is byte-identical to input.",
    "Native Diagnostics sets and pairs retain request order. Saved Diagnostics sets/pairs are empty. SetConversion basis records which retained representation was used; it does not alter original ParsedRegionSet issues.",
    "PairConversion manifest_origin batch means manifest_file is the actual retained batch identity and batch_pair_index is the original comparison ordinal; pair means actual standalone manifest identity with null batch_pair_index; none means both null.",
    "WorkerCapture is a nested selected-result receipt handoff, not a new authority registry. Its input/output identities come from actual shared capture helper results. A null qualified result has no qualified output captures; separate actual diagnostic captures remain under the original action.",
    "Analytic-empty with current unavailable operands requires the narrow section6 G1 refinement. Original derivation/outcome/native completeness facts stay unchanged, current capture extent becomes unavailable, parsed pair becomes unavailable. Available contradictory nonempty inputs still reject.",
    "Pure G1/G3a define all numbers and field selection. This transport adds no scientific calculation, annotation credit, stopping policy or prompt template.",
    "driver_state describes the already recorded original execution/capture branch. not_started requires actual lifecycle evidence; missing manifests alone do not establish it. Later loss never rewrites original records.",
    "Missing/mismatched inputs with no invocation use selected derivation bedtools_intersect and outcome not_executed, not not_executed_invalid_input. That latter derivation requires actual original verified malformed-input facts. Started execution with no usable pair facts has outcome unknown.",
    "WorkerCapture.result null implies outputs empty; nonnull result implies four captures in result-output order with exactly matching declarations. worker_result_file may retain an observed corrupt result as diagnostic identity while result stays null.",
    "Independent pair-seal adapter checks exact original identity/fingerprints, derivation-specific invocation facts, fixed roles/paths, and actual captured seal; no BatchManifest or SetOutput observations are fabricated. Current maps qualify scientific use separately."
  ],
